<title>USA: Eastman Chemical completes epoxybutene plant.</title>
<headline>Eastman Chemical completes epoxybutene plant.</headline>
<dateline>LONGVIEW, Texas 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Chemical Co said Thursday that it has completed building an epoxybutene derivatives plant with a capacity of three million pounds a year.</p>
<p>Epoxybutene derivatives will be used in agricultural and pharmaceutical products such as herbicides for corn and antibiotics, the company said, adding that it is researching new applications.</p>
